Śvēta names father Sudēva and brother Suratha --- Śvēta rules righteously then retires to forest lake --- Śvēta gains Brahmalōka after fierce tapas --- Hunger thirst torment Śvēta in heaven --- Brahmā assigns own flesh as unfailing food --- Brahmā promises Agastya entry will free Śvēta --- Śvēta offers jewel and begs rescue --- Agastya accepts jewel and Śvēta regains heaven